Every immutable regular package file except release/audit is pinned, including pin-names itself without a hash cycle. The audit self-excludes only its own bytes/metadata; an external exact audit anchor and complete external inventory bind every package entry including audit. Files are0444 except release0644; directories0700. Future separately authorized activation may change only state,executionAuthorized,activationAuthorized,authorizedBy,authorizationMessage. All other fields and pins remain fixed, original prepared0 release is preserved externally, audit is never rewritten, and the future driver binds activated release hash. No activation was performed.

